678
00:41:38,528 --> 00:41:39,188
Zaten ortam

679
00:41:39,188 --> 00:41:39,867
savaş ortamı.

680
00:41:40,188 --> 00:41:41,427
Hani şimdi kimsenin

681
00:41:41,427 --> 00:41:42,648
